Is AI a Robot? AI vs Robots Explained Simply
Robots and Artificial Intelligence (AI) are two distinct fields that often overlap, but they are not the same. Robots are physical machines that perform tasks, while AI is the intelligence software (the brain) allowing machines to learn and make decisions
